    {
      "source_id": "hu:1430742",
      "source_url": "https://m.humoruniv.com/board/read.html?table=pds&number=1430742",
      "title": "외국 누나가 가 본 김밥 축제.jpg",
      "body": "\n<p>\n\n</p><div><p>\n</p><div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:a66612879cedcb4323fbf2f3806a21cb4939a6a6e140c4b5dff68b33482cf8df\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:46b879d64d1b2da8e0d3316454e797ac0d6bb114506f99000789e56a178f3a8a\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>미국 누나가 김천 김밥 축제에 가려 한다 함</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:94a0863e8625a362a5b7166f39eacffc9c422371187c2299009799b8879cfeb9\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>첨단 선진적 고속 열차 시스틈에 대해서 잠시 어필</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:46f65a8590163888a25c24ccb4c6f8b7b09d15d5ccc44b6cebe26ff089fc3ad6\"/></p><p> </p><p><b><span>한적 하니 괜찮은 듯</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:c18d25a3a1ff69ba54ea8bc9c37030cef36bd0a9fd3f6efb85e4d88e255af20e\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>도착 역에서 부터 어필 하나 봄</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:fed61af9de71d4ec250b01beb0af2323c96730a2dde8d73b475d066ba6c6dd47\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>동네는 상당히 깨끗하게 잘 되어 있음</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:0b16312a7a00465447b771df11aa9dd3459bd532215b189574284e83ade33679\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>1000원 할인 받을 수 있는 특권</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:00c7e2c34c1d5fffd81efbc7b3b3cb20c23162fa9e74d4e2e01e56114370d101\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>버스타고 안 까지 다시 이동</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:481c2c432b2ccfcbe9ab7a52e7554604c7dade4ae224bf249e147a28123a9884\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>날씨가 비가 옴</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:29e17f406a107b63426a8d23160208c41cef43072ab7937d0dffe9fde2d605f0\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>이런 풍경을 외국인들이 되게 좋아한다 하더라구 멀리 산과 녹음이 우거져 있는 그 풍경 말임</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:843413ecdefd357b0a82cd63e7d40f4cb58a09309147dd24dc53619fb227cfa0\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:e6facdc0c961db8b6b92fd2d8b0f100d27cfcc1b6793ae2bc9fb0a2c806939a8\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>군밤</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:faad42b08f5db4a5565f8a8ba9352457a3e807e03cd4618d23c191a91175cd89\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>안내 지도는 잘 되어 있음 </span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:b0cb933235091a86d8c0ec7ea2d8a4f9af271e61598211bd5d63df9ee7b2d257\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>첨단 시대인 만큼 스맛펀으로 미리 알 수 있구</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:09fa0f23a5911a0f22416e028fd461eaf5468ecaa1783cf0d641c5853475d98e\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>각종 팀들이 준비 해서 참여 하나 봄</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:ce06db0afada1a1b37200ee006928b899b44ae2c6067d6e49961bf00a09132b9\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>지역민들의 힘</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:c785cc6dd78ea71947d56f04859dfaa82c6107469a6f7302caf4ebce8b2a4680\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:a73499643eac6a303001b83e3ee96df409b9bd6aee60dfdfdfdc8cbd550c855b\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:07862394710f03e52a66e854878dd52b2ac6f65257572ba8b0bbe0fa8e9b3782\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>스탠다드한 느낌의 김밥임 영양소로서는 비타민 단백질 탄수화물 그런 것들이 부족할 일이 없는 듯?</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>햄버거랑 비슷한 느낌의 음식 아닐려나</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:637c538476843147d59306830254515725f2f0f3b9e058024af3b5da606cf2f9\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:c2cb9526191fb7fdca68c322cd7d12dbe08d9b1d28e96e9e4d4f9bff7c5ffc2e\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>여러종류의 김밥을 즉석에서</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:c5d68dd28e0a6c25eaa5e94fc35ba80833ed4905e24d2cd6611d88d3d841fbf4\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:948c8a4db9a266e85bfa02bf772e024ff1f16086f728967654f5c5e763f4e8c1\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:ecd471dc4093e66e98a59f9cfbbbb9bc8902c6ba07476a98b45b3adee8596fc0\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:9708ae96ef7ba1724b433a26fe6e39143a04f3259f4f9fe00589d95bc70ff2d2\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>샤인 머스킷이랑 사과 인 듯</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:ca5231fdaf9c3fbb7fc44caa3324ea7e0bc471cacf9023ab2bd583979c9e695c\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:fb09a83a27383e3ccb5c31cd08bab12e993c34bb5074881fd84c320dfbded037\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>샤인 머스킷일까 거봉일까</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:554b758bd9f6633bc30c3d95956f3d7b5c7852680e355fe3008569c44b28a7ac\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>사과를 아뽀 라고 발음 하던...애플이라고 하면 안 되는 듯?</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:993ed26b99d10f4f8c916e82c987c53c1e0aaccf173e64a404e43e534ed53590\"/></p><p> </p><p><b><span>쌀 소비 촉진 행사도 겸한 홍보물</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:0d60ca967c03638bea12b93d4034decb4574290b2bc1784cb214d87f2231ee4a\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>이거는 우리가 일반적으로 즐기는 김이랑 나물밥으로 먹는 김밥인데 이게 맛이 참 좋을 거임 꼬숩고</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>곤드레 같은 거려나</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:07c9d66ada8cf38af37776102812d2fe569fd26dc21a7a9ed13830dce304f3dc\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:9276b40d67479130bc0c87e7df5a268594600d1d992841b2aff30981b06aaf9c\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>키오스크도 다 구비 되어 있구</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:aae8f66fff4b1592b24020ae1c7e333dc644874a2d4e63db7d735863a1aeadd7\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>삼겹살이 들어가는 김밥</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:ffce2dd0ca9a1abd728d16483c7f2e93db6bbe80348d26c22ad71d8a98f46778\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>다들 삼겹살 졓아들 함?</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:8ad42ad8578083aebf1c4d8a565032e8978abf978fa63e3845e6d83d1392c8eb\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>굉장히 각양각색의 김밥이 있음 색감이 화려하지</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:dcae9f09cc6cacc57ef2587c08da109a19c5902110117bf5402dd204580f3645\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>단색 김밥도 있구</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:1fea1b5b3b5f3829a8490ac6dd3fe7871cf59e98d0728d1ed528e0ae7e32ebdb\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>타코 같은 퓨전식 김밥</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:8bbcf5c90cdbfde973581860aab68fca20e1b5f93c32d811fd39a55067326e37\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:2a9f6fa019b86b3265dab6acd4235cd0c33fb4b896055e2bfe8d9164d75a7cda\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>원산지는 중국산도 있구나 모범 김밥 이지만 물가가 비싸져서 그런 듯</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:d0f96cc033fcce990bd09390daa1d615f9faa80eb4257375f577d2ab08196acc\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:919fa2d1aa19363f69f696e90c3844fe1c53753c3607033b82e36b3ddccaeb9d\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:8dc1d69ef4a9859e01a7ea6f08b990b3ccc442a9691577c862ff02b52fe1c8e5\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:d6db0ddc27f9ec2e74a84b369ea1b759104a6159b5dfa7d63cc99025ef415b9d\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>녹음이 우거진 풍경...자연속의 사람들...</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:5382396e59c10929fee0fc928f791e61ba9a3d9fba41c457df0d17662fe3d838\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>열매...모과 혹은 무화과 겠음?</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:30f3379c97b0baf3d03368d6f3ff3a22a1d0b04f5f3ef1bbffb0372eeab01f72\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>디저트</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:33ee5feff15aa9d5de54546faed2bbb121448d2344433f84e588143c8c1a4d6b\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:daafed6226a280e220c1a03d31d9fe06fa07f8a883752bdc3d8d469541e0bfba\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:299ad9e88bcbd132a8d779a5f9f3dfb09bff2d05b19918f515896b5119bd8e87\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:144ed9c778926e9cb72c0c76825a420a99eb72f833c269251df72a3cf875d0f1\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:a711cb033fa9ac5acf4c25223838b90cd613eb5b8e7d62b1ade7d852d95cbf1a\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>굉장히 맛있겠어</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:48b0748b0169cccbbfd93a7735c3af6d4c0d02ddf9a67f702f8517dd4ddceaac\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:ac8a8de733e40e764303d021de67fe9d850cfa750fc75d7d8600d9f00827e467\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:4d0f894568d6d82a85d4742870c02546a49f5dd9ce105c5bca9b2d729ef20744\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:068b59b5117f90a77c324a4c45664c2f2a721c31199676220720f31de6bf2ac3\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>와앙</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:c55a781d9800dad55e9381175660391cf37a759a9ea6ef4b22eaab2c3e2b6c98\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:7cd901e9670ee6c7e219f5f42c749fc4f90944c8013309d03e83dad98a8afbb9\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:7369690c32bba5ca613fbae2a2e3e0553be7c6bdcd8ed1ee324a010987abad64\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>냠</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:45bb03da83aed7a407025fa9e9eccd9f40e18bbe284c39364cf45c2bbf62741c\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>저 안개 낀 거 봐 날씨가 안 좋음에도 진풍경 이긴 해 촉촉한 느낌이 전해져 오지</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:3543f989e55558af37d8d7d51b7334278a150db5bc2a57ae38703ef01e12f837\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:1f3c5febde54d52f85c75190025b77982aad64c98a621b10833fca8cc51552ea\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:aafb12b4518af25e10ebd99fa933abc5865e5b26c3589b30db72d2a31267e281\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:6a247dce8447911b5182abedc044d09bdfdea0783924fc2da12494adc7607367\"/></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>상당히 맛있게 즐기셨다 함</span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p></div>\n<p></p>\n",
